<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S8.SS3" title="In 8 Discussion ‣ Nurture-First Agent Development: Building Domain-Expert AI Agents Through Conversational Knowledge Crystallization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8.3 </span>Broader Implications</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Nurture-First Agent Development: Building Domain-Expert AI Agents Through Conversational Knowledge Crystallization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Nurture-First Agent Development: Building Domain-Expert AI Agents Through Conversational Knowledge Crystallization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
