</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.5.9.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T1.5.9.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:136.6pt;">
